{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "51825410-c41f-8bfd-b8d6-a364bb5f1e63",
  "created_at": "2026-02-17T14:07:21-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniel Tran",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:01:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:01:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, good afternoon, Lorraine. Is it all right if I ask a question about trash? I hope I've got the right department."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:01:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You do, trash and recycling both come through us. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:01:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. I'm on speakerphone, by the way, my hands are full of, well, paperwork. Is it all right if I ask you to tell me if I'm too quiet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:01:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're coming through fine. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:01:42-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, I have an old couch. It's a sleeper sofa, actually, pretty heavy. I'd like to put it out at the curb. Can I do that, or is there a special way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:01:55-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A couch is considered a bulk item, so it isn't picked up with your regular trash. It does need to be set up for a bulk pickup. Is it a regular curbside pickup house, a single family home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:02:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a single family. I own it. Well, I'm the homeowner, I mean, I live there. Is it all right if I ask what day they'd come?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:02:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Your pickup day depends on your street, so I'd need your address to look that up. Bulk items usually go out on your normal trash day, but they have to be scheduled ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:02:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah. Is it all right if I don't give the address? I'd rather not on the phone, I'm a little old-fashioned that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:02:45-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's okay. Then I'll give you the general process and you can confirm your day on the city website or call back. Bulk pickup is something you schedule first, then you put the item out the night before or early that morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:03:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so I schedule first. [pause] And is there a fee? I should have asked that right off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:03:10-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There can be a fee for bulk items, yes. I don't have the exact amount in front of me, and it can depend on the item. When you schedule it, they'll tell you what it is before you commit to anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:03:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. So the fee depends on the item. A couch would be, um, one of the bigger ones, I guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:03:35-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a larger item, yes. Let me repeat what you've got so far. Sleeper sofa, single family home, schedule ahead, fee possible, confirm the amount when you book. Does that sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:03:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds exactly right. You're very patient. Is it all right if I ask one more thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:03:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:03:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If the couch is wet, from sitting in the garage, say, would they still take it? It's a bit damp from the cold, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:04:07-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd mention that when you schedule. Wet or soiled upholstered items sometimes get handled differently. It's a good question for the person booking it. If you can, wrap it in plastic, or keep it covered until the morning of."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:04:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cover it until the morning. I can do that. I've got an old tarp."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:04:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works fine. Just don't block the sidewalk, and keep it clear of the trash bins so the truck can get to everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:04:39-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Clear of the bins, not on the sidewalk. Got it. Is it all right if I tell you why I'm clearing things out? It's a little off topic."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:04:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go right ahead, I've got a minute."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:04:55-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, my landlord is raising the rent next spring, so I'm weighing my options. Whether to stay or move. So I'm going through everything and getting rid of what I don't need, so either way it's easier."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:05:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that makes sense. It's good to get ahead of it. Either way you'll have less to move."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:05:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Less to carry. I'm too old to haul a sleeper sofa up and down stairs anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:05:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No argument there. Do you have other bulk items besides the couch? You may be able to put several out on the same pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:05:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's useful. I might have a small bookshelf, and a couple of broken chairs. Is it all right if I ask whether they count as separate items?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:05:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Each piece is typically counted on its own, so the fee, if there is one, could add up. When you schedule, tell them everything you plan to put out, and they'll give you a total."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:06:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tell them everything up front. I will. And who do I call to schedule? Is it this same line?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:06:08-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can call this same line, and we'll get you set up, or I can take your name and number and have someone from the trash side call you back. Which would you prefer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:06:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A callback would be lovely, if it's not too much trouble. Is it all right if I give you the number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:06:31-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:06:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's four oh one, five five five, oh one five eight. And the name is Daniel Tran. T-R-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:06:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Daniel Tran, T-R-A-N, four oh one, five five five, oh one five eight. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:06:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:06:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And I'll note it's for a bulk pickup, a sleeper sofa, possibly a bookshelf and two chairs, and that you'd like to know the fee. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:07:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that covers it. Is it all right if I say you've been very kind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:07:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's very nice of you. Someone will get back to you, probably within a day or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:07:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. Thank you, Lorraine. You have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T14:07:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Tran. Take care."
    }
  ],
